  "description": "Christmas Seamless Pattern Bundle – 10 Designs\nBring holiday magic to your creative projects with this beautifully curated 10-pattern Christmas Seamless Bundle! This set includes a wide variety of festive themes—cozy villages, kawaii characters, gingerbread cookies, Nordic motifs, ornaments, snowflakes, winter woodland animals, glowing lights, candy themes, and classic Christmas plaid.\nPerfect for sellers, scrapbookers, surface designers, crafters, POD creators, and digital artists wanting high-quality, ready-to-use holiday patterns.\nWHAT’S INCLUDED:\n✔ 10 High-Resolution Seamless Patterns\n✔ 3000×3000 px (or your preferred size)\n✔ 300 DPI Print Quality\n✔ PNG / JPG seamless tiles\n✔ Instant digital download\n✔ Perfectly repeating, clean, and crisp\n PATTERN THEMES YOU GET:\nCozy Christmas Village\nKawaii Santa & Reindeer\nGingerbread Cookies\nNordic Scandinavian Christmas\nClassic Ornaments & Baubles\nElegant Snowflakes\nChristmas Candy & Peppermint\nWoodland Winter Animals\nGlowing Holiday Lights\nClassic Christmas Plaid\nUSE THESE FOR:\n• Scrapbooking\n• Gift wrapping paper\n• Seamless POD products\n• Fabric printing\n• T-shirt & apparel backgrounds\n• Sticker sheets\n• Digital planners\n• Card making\n• Wall art & posters\n• Social media graphics\n• Crafts & DIY projects\nPERFECT FOR SELLERS:\nThese patterns are designed with Etsy, Creative Fabrica, and POD optimization in mind, featuring clean repeats and aesthetic Christmas themes that buyers search for every holiday season.\nINSTANT DOWNLOAD:\nOnce purchased, your files will be available immediately—no waiting, no shipping.\nWhy You’ll Love This Pack:\n• Unique and professionally designed\n• High-resolution & seamless\n• Works with any design software\n• Perfect for both beginners and professionals\n• Must-have set for holiday crafting and digital shops",
